#{[17592186059578 :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n![](images/4d/4d90e81043121495ae8bb7742400b2c9e705cb7d706f553a6ab2aec44b35d017.png)"] [17592186059578 :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n![](images/3e/3e7f783023405be3ea79a740998fefac3a6ea909e9903f5ea300a9234ae63003.png)"] [17592186059579 :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](images/d8/d89417b7eb2d000bbd81fcf4a89ca7eaa5529fc56d9b41bf6e8bb237d2eb9e16.png)"] [17592186059579 :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](images/93/93874fa93cfd9ef3df1492bbc35056c2381157740d8ca26b475474faf54ee4d1.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](images/83/8356d9148bc06d76a5aee41e4a07651c43d94b2496d9542eb8b6e01ee52ea161.png)"]}
